384: ### 5.1 webOS Dedicated Media Keys
385: When playback is active, the remote media keys trigger:
386: | Key | Keycode | Action | Execution Path |
387: |---|---|---|---|
388: | Play | 415 | `MEDIA_PLAY` | `PlayerController.play()`, `PlayerOSDController.resetIdleTimer()` |
389: | Pause | 19 | `MEDIA_PAUSE` | `PlayerController.pause()`, `PlayerOSDController.showHUD()` |
390: | Play/Pause | 179 | `MEDIA_PLAY_PAUSE` | `PlayerController.togglePlayPause()` |
391: | Stop | 413 / 178 | `MEDIA_STOP` | `CinejoyApp.exitPlayer()` (initiates 5-stage teardown, switches to details) |
392: | FastForward | 417 / 228 | `MEDIA_FAST_FORWARD` | `PlayerController.seek(10)`, `showSeekFeedback(true, 10)` |
393: | Rewind | 412 / 227 | `MEDIA_REWIND` | `PlayerController.seek(-10)`, `showSeekFeedback(false, 10)` |
394: | Back | 461 / 27 | `BACK` | Hierarchical: closes modal if open; otherwise `CinejoyApp.exitPlayer()` |
