396: ### 5.2 Spatial D-Pad Navigation Graph
397: - **HUD Visible State**:
398:   - `data-nav-tier="top"`: `#player-back-btn`
399:   - `data-nav-tier="scrubber"`: `#osd-scrubber` (role="slider")
400:   - `data-nav-tier="actions"`: `#osd-rewind-btn` -> `#osd-play-btn` -> `#osd-forward-btn` -> `#osd-subtitles-btn` -> `#osd-server-btn`
401:   - When `#osd-scrubber` is focused, `ArrowLeft` / `ArrowRight` adjusts seek head without losing focus.
402: - **HUD Hidden State (`.osd-hidden`)**:
403:   - `ArrowLeft`: Seeks backward (-10s), displays seek feedback toast, wakes HUD (`showHUD()`).
404:   - `ArrowRight`: Seeks forward (+10s), displays seek feedback toast, wakes HUD (`showHUD()`).
405:   - `ArrowUp` / `ArrowDown`: Wakes HUD (`showHUD()`), sets spatial focus directly to `#osd-play-btn`.
406:   - `Enter` / `OK` (13): Wakes HUD (`showHUD()`), toggles play/pause.
407: 
408: ### 5.3 OSD Auto-Hide Timer Lifecycle
409: - The OSD automatically hides after **4000ms** of user inactivity while video is actively PLAYING.
410: - **Permanent Inactivity Suspension**:
411:   - The auto-hide timer is canceled and permanently suspended while the video is PAUSED (asserted in `app/test-m5.js` S3.3 and `adversarial-m5-osd-remote.js` ADV-S4.3).
412:   - The timer is canceled and suspended while any modal dialog (Subtitles, Server, Error) is active (`_activeModal !== null`).
413: - **Activity Reset**:
414:   - Any remote keypress, mouse movement, or seek command calls `resetIdleTimer()`, resetting the 4000ms countdown.
415:   - Race condition immunity: Keystrokes arriving at the 3950ms–4050ms boundary reset the timer without premature HUD hiding (`ADV-S4.1`, `ADV-S4.2`).
